                            "playtime_forever": 557,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 557,
                            "deck_playtime_at_review": 557,
                            "last_played": 1784316823
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Played it by chance on a friend's Switch, and it immediately reminded me of The Lost Vikings.\nBought it on Steam and played it on Steam Deck; it's very fun, though frustrating at times.\nIt still has a few bugs, but overall it's perfectly playable without needing too many workarounds.\nIt gave me about 10 hours of playtime, and I might even try to get the best rating for every level.\nIt could be useful to have a save option in longer levels, the ability to spawn directly at the grave, a timer at the top, and a death counter.\n\nI really hope there will be a sequel.",
